      "summary": {
        "nb": "Furuset kirke er en kirke fra 1980 i Ellingsrud og Furuset menighet i Groruddalen prosti i Oslo bispedømme i Bydel Alna i Oslo.",
        "en": "Furuset Church is a church that was consecrated in 1980. The church is located in the neighborhood of Furuset in Oslo, Norway. In the same area was a church in the Middle Ages, from which keys of iron were found, are preserved and placed in the present church."
